"Account used to book the loss when an asset is sold below its book value or "
"disposed of."
msgstr "資産を帳簿価額より低く売却または処分した場合に損失を計上する勘定科目。"

#. module: om_account_asset
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_account_asset.field_account_asset_asset__account_asset_id
